SUMMARY:Intermediate Watercolor with Misuk Goltz (5-sessions)
DESCRIPTION:Pence Adult Art Programs\nThis 5-week workshop with Misuk Golt
 z will focus on using your brushes to their full potential and practicing 
 diverse hand motions to achieve painterly\, expressive watercolor painting
 s. Students will learn how to distribute different values to create balanc
 ed and sophisticated artwork while painting various subjects. Please note 
 that this class is intended for participants who have previous experience 
 with watercolor techniques and color blending. The use of high-quality wat
 ercolor materials is strongly recommended to achieve the best results.\n\n
 Intermediate Watercolor with Misuk Goltz\nTuesdays\\\, 10 AM \\- 12 PM \\|
  September 1\\\, 8\\\, 15\\\, 22\\\, 29\n$170 Members\, $190 Non-Members (
 Materials not included)\n\n**Registration is required through the [Pence's
  website (CLICK HERE)](https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/worksho
 ps-and-classes/).**\n\nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/pence-adult-art-programs/events/31602
 2027/
