SUMMARY:Stained Glass Workshop with Salty Bird Glass
DESCRIPTION:Pence Adult Art Programs\nJoin instructor Tiara Nixon with Sal
 ty Bird Glass to learn the timeless art of Tiffany-style stained glass. In
  this workshop\, you will learn how to apply copper foil\, solder\, and fi
 nish your own beautiful 5” pumpkin. No prior stained glass experience is
  needed\, and this workshop is open to artists ages 14 and above. Space is
  limited!\n\nStained Glass Workshop with Salty Bird Glass\nSunday\\\, Octo
 ber 11 \\| 1\\-3:30 PM\n$125 Members\, $140 Non-Members (All materials inc
 luded)\n\nPlease read the safety & liability form on our website before re
 gistering for this workshop.\n\n**Registration is required through the [Pe
 nce's website (CLICK HERE)](https://pencegallery.org/education/programs/wo
 rkshops-and-classes/).**\n\nAny questions? Email pencegallery@gmail.com.
